    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the Convention on the suppression of TerroristFinancing Act, No. 25 of 2005 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and thelegal effect of that section as amended is to\u2014",
    "fonts": [
