      161.85,
      305.09,
      401.9,
      341.63
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Convention on theSuppression of Terrorist Financing (Amendment) Act,No. of 2012.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.73,
      401.9,
      405.23
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Convention on the Suppression ofTerrorist Financing Act, No. 25 of 2005 (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended asfollows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      419.33,
      401.86,
      443.39
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the repeal of subsection (2A) thereof and thesubstitution therefor of the following:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.85,
      457.49,
      401.87,
      519.47
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2A) Any person who unlawfully and willfullyby any direct or indirect means provides orconspires to provide, material support or resourcesto any terrorist, terrorists or a terrorist organizationshall be guilty of an offence under this Act.\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      533.57,
      401.88,
      595.79
    ],
    "text": "(2)in subsection (3) thereof by the substitution for thewords and figures \u201cspecified in subsection (1) orsubsection (2) of this section\u201d of the words andfigures \u201cspecified in subsection (1), subsection (2)or subsection (2A) of this section\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      609.89,
      401.88,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(3)in subsection (4) thereof by the substitution for thewords and figures \u201cunder subsection (1) orsubsection (2) of this section,\u201d, of the words andfigures \u201cunder subsection (1), subsection (2) orsubsection (2A) of this section,\u201d.",
